  or ordinary prose. Continue independent work while waiting. Default optional preferences; wait
  for authorization, destructive-action, and material product decisions. Silence is not approval.
  Name any blocking decision.

# Workflow

- Map the surface, then read exact files. Use bounded parallel agents/tools for broad exploration,
  with distinct scopes and explicit deliverables.
- Continue implementation through edits, verification, and status unless blocked. Treat corrections
  and side questions as steering; retain the objective and completed work across compaction unless
  the user replaces it.
- Satisfy repo checks and prove affected contracts; existing boundary tests can suffice. Broaden or
  repeat passing checks only for new changes, failures, or unresolved evidence. Report limits
  without expanding authority.

