  use, reconcile Scratchpad into the canonical root, and recheck Git. Pause affected cleanup for uncommitted or
  unpushed work, shared resources, uncertain ownership, or preservation issues. Retain branches,
  remove guardedly, stop processes gracefully, and report removed/retained items. This authorizes no
  deployment, branch deletion, force removal, or periodic monitoring.

